        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          129 Kandih Ganv hei Luaiguang Pwthe.",
            "                              8.8.9. 10. Ref. 6. 6.8. 6. 6.8",
            "",
            "          1. Kandih ganv hei luaiguang pwthe,",
            "             Zinghmei hei guang khithkhit bam the.",
            "             Ramh ningtow makna lungc bammei guay,",
            "             Lunghlaic la tho kaganv naibam khouhei.",
            "",
            "                     Lunghlaicna hanguang tho (2)",
            "                     Jisu rui nang ta khwan bam the.",
            "                     Puancthanh makmei guay mu (2)",
            "                     Tingkauhramc khou gut ngam lak ge.",
            "",
            "          2. Zingcguang the kandihramc khouhei",
            "             Jisu khou nang guanglou la tho.",
            "             Nang chaeng khou ryanraamei 'riu sihnic,",
            "             Kamei rui nang ta kadanlou pwni.",
            "",
            "          3. Tingmik rui tat bammei kumcna,",
            "             Nang panty nic tatna bam e.",
            "             Jisu khou nang bam tanhtan ethei,",
            "             Panty khou neihlaamei ariu pwni.",
            "",
            "          4. Aniw panty hei naibam khou,",
            "             'Niw rui kalatryan piu ethei,",
            "             Neihlaamei padikna bam pwni,",
            "             Siimei rui aniw ta ngam dat lak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
